tor of the National Telecommunications and Information Administration from 2022 to 2023.","extract_html":"<p><b>April Lynn McClain Delaney</b> is an American lawyer and politician who is a member of the U.S. House of Representatives representing Maryland's 6th congressional district since 2025. She previously served as the deputy administrator of the National Telecommunications and Information Administration from 2022 to 2023.</p>"}